  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Pastel_Shaders/BH_Pastel_Shaders_Header.png\" alt=\"Pastel Shader&#x27;s logo\" width=\"1024\" height=\"324\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flunapixel.studio%252fdiscord\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/790272037578473512?label=Discord&color=ffe8e9&labelColor=ffced2&style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=blue\" width=\"205\" height=\"26\"></a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<em><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/SUPPORTS-IRIS, OCULUS, OPTIFINE | 1.7 to 1.20-ffe8e9?style=for-the-badge&logo=CurseForge&labelColor=ffced2\" width=\"385\" height=\"28\">&nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252felocindev\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/ElocinDev-SUPPORT ME-ffe8e9?style=for-the-badge&logo=Ko-Fi&labelColor=ffced2\" width=\"212\" height=\"27\"></a></em><em>&nbsp;</em>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fELOCIN\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Pastel_Shaders/BH_Pastel_Shaders_Promo.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1018\" height=\"151\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Pastel Shaders 是一款具有多种色彩预设的风格化美学光影包</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/977751810922131456/1066006073456197652/presets-transparent.gif\" alt=\"All three presets featured in Pastel Shaders\" width=\"1200\" height=\"608\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/977751810922131456/1066223943956041748/highperformance.png\" alt=\"Pastel is a high performance shader.\" width=\"1120\" height=\"567\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>🎨 多种色彩预设</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">提供粉色、蓝色和黄色等多种柔和色调调色板供您选择！</p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>🌌 宁静的氛围</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;提供接近原版的游戏体验，拥有清澈的星空。美丽的日出和日落。</p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>✏️ 高度可定制</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;无论是新手还是高级用户，自定义设置都既简单又几乎不受限制！</p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>⚙️ 用户友好的设置菜单</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;觉得设置太多让你不知所措？Pastel 拥有类似大多数</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">现代游戏的快速设置功能。</p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>💻 兼容大多数现代电脑</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;即使对于低端显卡甚至集成显卡也进行了优化！</p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>☁️ <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/insanity-shader\" rel=\"nofollow\">Insanity Shaderpack</a> 的姐妹版</strong></span>\n<p>Pastel 是 Insanity 的对立面版本，它基于 BSL Shaders &hearts;！</p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
